1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 3=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:02:31,599 --> 00:02:32,319
Father.

7
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:38,240
Now that you're back,

8
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:40,840
you should rein in
that boorish behavior of yours.

9
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:44,159
This is not
that filthy military camp of yours.

10
00:02:45,759 --> 00:02:47,080
I care about my parents.

11
00:02:47,256 --> 00:02:49,400
I rushed back
the moment I received my transfer order.

12
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:53,680
Now that I've seen
how energetic you are, Father,

13
00:02:54,639 --> 00:02:55,639
I'm relieved.

14
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:58,039
I still need to greet Mother,

15
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,319
so I'll be leaving.

16
00:03:18,020 --> 00:03:22,020
(Lin Family, Rongzhang House)

17
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:25,360
Greetings, Mother.

18
00:03:28,216 --> 00:03:29,520
I'm glad that you've returned.

19
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:31,240
I'm so glad.

20
00:03:32,540 --> 00:03:35,000
(Qin Shunhua, Lin Jinqi's Mother,
Lin Family's First Madam)

21
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:35,759
Hurry.

22
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:37,199
Let me take a look.

23
00:03:37,759 --> 00:03:38,280
Come.

24
00:03:43,719 --> 00:03:45,199
Have you lost weight?

25
00:03:57,919 --> 00:03:58,759
Qi.

26
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:02,080
You've suffered.

27
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,360
I got scratched

28
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:06,680
when I was cleaning the weapons.

29
00:04:07,439 --> 00:04:08,680
It only looks scary.

30
00:04:12,319 --> 00:04:13,000
Are you sure?

31
00:04:14,319 --> 00:04:16,439
I'd never dare lie to you, Mother.

32
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:20,319
You were gone for six years.

33
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:22,120
Finally, you're back.

34
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:28,120
From now on, I want you by my side,

35
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:30,480
living your life with your wife.

36
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:33,000
Give birth to children soon.

37
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,160
Then,

38
00:04:34,839 --> 00:04:36,600
both our families will be at ease.

39
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:43,120
It's all thanks to Old Master Zhao

40
00:04:43,959 --> 00:04:45,519
that you no longer have to fight.

41
00:04:45,639 --> 00:04:46,720
You get to return to Jinling

42
00:04:47,319 --> 00:04:48,360
and even get a promotion.

43
00:04:51,199 --> 00:04:53,360
When you see your wife later,

44
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:55,199
say a few gentle words to her.

45
00:04:57,800 --> 00:04:58,720
You are right, Mother.

46
00:05:03,540 --> 00:05:09,660
(Lin Family's Zhichun Hall)

47
00:05:28,660 --> 00:05:32,540
(Zhao Xingtang, Lin Jinqi's Wife)

48
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:36,680
Young Madam,

49
00:05:37,404 --> 00:05:39,279
Young Master has returned.

50
00:05:39,928 --> 00:05:41,260
(Qingxiang)
Judging by the time,

51
00:05:41,368 --> 00:05:43,360
he should probably
arrive in Zhichun Hall by now.

52
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:44,248
(Zhao Xingtang's Head Maid)

53
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:46,480
That's his business.

54
00:05:48,879 --> 00:05:51,680
Should I go out
and kneel to welcome him?

55
00:05:51,870 --> 00:05:54,104
I dare not trouble you, Young Lady Zhao.

56
00:05:55,096 --> 00:05:56,728
- Young Master.
- Young Master.

57
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:07,839
Young Master.

58
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:41,800
Young Master, you're back.

59
00:06:43,199 --> 00:06:44,439
I haven't congratulated you

60
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:46,759
on getting your promotion

61
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:48,079
to a top position.

62
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,759
Young Lady Zhao,

63
00:06:53,519 --> 00:06:55,920
when did you learn
to be so pretentious?

64
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,639
Why not behave like you used to?

65
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:02,800
We'll be direct and upfront.

66
00:07:04,879 --> 00:07:06,279
I'm more used to that.

67
00:07:22,759 --> 00:07:23,879
As expected of Young Master,

68
00:07:23,880 --> 00:07:25,480
who has become
the assistant commander.

69
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:28,480
You're acting so mighty now.

70
00:07:30,319 --> 00:07:31,720
However,

71
00:07:32,959 --> 00:07:34,199
when the Lin family

72
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:37,600
came rushing to beg the Zhao family
for a marriage back then,

73
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:41,079
why didn't I see you

74
00:07:42,319 --> 00:07:43,800
acting all high and mighty?

75
00:07:48,199 --> 00:07:49,480
If you have the time,

76
00:07:50,199 --> 00:07:53,000
you should advise
the Zhao family's Old Master

77
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:56,720
not to be so greedy.

78
00:07:57,319 --> 00:07:58,480
I dared

79
00:07:59,199 --> 00:08:01,480
to join the army back then

80
00:08:02,408 --> 00:08:03,480
because I didn't want

81
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:05,959
to become a puppet of the Zhao family.

82
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:12,800
A mere assistant commander

83
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:14,680
made me transfer
from Jinzhou back to Jinling.

84
00:08:15,079 --> 00:08:17,199
Do you still expect me

85
00:08:18,079 --> 00:08:19,560
to be grateful to the Zhao family?

86
00:08:20,439 --> 00:08:20,920
You...

87
00:08:24,839 --> 00:08:26,879
Whenever you want a divorce,

88
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:28,959
just tell me.

89
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:33,559
I will send you away with a parade.

90
00:08:44,799 --> 00:08:46,200
You ingrate!

91
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:48,879
If it weren't for the Zhao family,

92
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:51,840
the Lin family would've shared
the same fate as the Shen family!

93
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:54,600
Trying to burn bridges now?

94
00:08:55,759 --> 00:08:56,919
Dream on!

95
00:09:14,980 --> 00:09:19,740
(Lin Family's Sanjue Hall,
Lin Jinqi's External Study)

96
00:09:22,039 --> 00:09:22,720
Young Master.

97
00:09:24,879 --> 00:09:25,679
The head butler

98
00:09:26,184 --> 00:09:27,550
has been waiting for a while.

99
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:31,120
Mr. Yang.

100
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:32,360
Young Master.

101
00:09:33,759 --> 00:09:36,440
I called you as soon as I returned

102
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:39,399
because I've missed you

103
00:09:39,958 --> 00:09:41,292
and wanted to greet you in person.

104
00:09:42,408 --> 00:09:43,720
Thank you for remembering me.

105
00:09:47,639 --> 00:09:48,480
The second reason

106
00:09:49,639 --> 00:09:51,480
is that Zhichun Hall's maids

107
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,200
seem unfamiliar to me.

108
00:09:53,928 --> 00:09:56,670
If I know what was going on,
I can still see it's the Lin Residence.

109
00:09:58,204 --> 00:09:59,240
If I didn't,

110
00:09:59,768 --> 00:10:02,504
I would've thought that
I'd wandered into the Zhao Residence.

111
00:10:09,639 --> 00:10:10,879
After you joined the army,

112
00:10:10,936 --> 00:10:12,712
the Young Madam
took charge of the household.

113
00:10:12,879 --> 00:10:14,600
The maids who used to serve you

114
00:10:14,879 --> 00:10:16,000
were getting old.

115
00:10:16,799 --> 00:10:19,080
Young Madam said
they might have other ideas

116
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:20,879
and no longer be loyal,

117
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:22,150
so she either got them married,

118
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:24,240
or sold them off to others.

119
00:10:27,679 --> 00:10:28,519
Where's Yuchan?

120
00:10:31,679 --> 00:10:32,559
Young Madam

121
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:35,080
married Yuchan off to the youngest son

122
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:36,840
of the head shopkeeper
of the rice shop, Liu.

123
00:10:38,159 --> 00:10:40,279
Isn't the head shopkeeper
of the rice shop

124
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,360
called Wang?

125
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:46,600
Shopkeeper Wang made a mistake

126
00:10:46,919 --> 00:10:48,480
and was punished by Young Madam.

127
00:10:48,759 --> 00:10:50,399
The second shopkeeper, Liu,

128
00:10:51,320 --> 00:10:52,639
was promoted.

129
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:57,080
I remember
the youngest son of the Liu family

130
00:10:59,240 --> 00:11:00,480
was a fool.

131
00:11:04,919 --> 00:11:05,720
Yes.

132
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:25,200
What are you doing?

133
00:11:26,039 --> 00:11:26,840
Get up.

134
00:11:27,080 --> 00:11:27,879
Stand.

135
00:11:33,039 --> 00:11:34,559
Now that I'm back,

136
00:11:35,639 --> 00:11:36,799
Zhichun Hall

137
00:11:37,656 --> 00:11:38,790
belongs to the Lin family.

138
00:11:41,679 --> 00:11:42,879
I understand.

139
00:11:49,759 --> 00:11:51,000
It smells amazing.

140
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:57,960
I heard your father
bought another painting yesterday.

141
00:11:58,270 --> 00:11:59,550
He received

142
00:11:59,688 --> 00:12:01,200
quite a handsome reward this year.

143
00:12:12,279 --> 00:12:13,799
He just got lucky.

144
00:12:13,870 --> 00:12:15,064
Why is she acting so arrogant?

145
00:12:17,879 --> 00:12:18,919
She gets to eat meat.

146
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:20,120
Of course, she's arrogant.

147
00:12:22,679 --> 00:12:23,519
All right.

148
00:12:24,399 --> 00:12:24,960
I've talked

149
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:26,840
to Liu, the second shopkeeper
of the fabric shop.

150
00:12:26,879 --> 00:12:27,990
After the Chinese New Year,

151
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:29,720
he will ask for his master's blessing

152
00:12:29,879 --> 00:12:31,480
to marry you to his eldest son.

153
00:12:35,544 --> 00:12:36,440
When the time comes,

154
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:37,919
you'll get to stay in a big house

155
00:12:38,039 --> 00:12:39,440
and eat meat every day.

156
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:42,440
Don't forget

157
00:12:42,639 --> 00:12:43,960
to take care of me, your mother.

158
00:12:49,519 --> 00:12:50,279
Mother.

159
00:13:01,519 --> 00:13:02,279
This...

160
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:03,960
The reward

161
00:13:03,960 --> 00:13:05,039
from yesterday's painting?

162
00:13:09,799 --> 00:13:11,039
It's all thanks to Lanxiang

163
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:13,490
for teaching me how to verify
the authenticity of paintings.

164
00:13:13,519 --> 00:13:14,799
I didn't make a mistake.

165
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:16,840
Father, it's because you are smart

166
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:18,039
and use what I taught you.

167
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:18,559
Here.

168
00:13:20,440 --> 00:13:21,799
Let me show you.

169
00:13:28,639 --> 00:13:29,639
If this goes on,

170
00:13:29,639 --> 00:13:30,840
will we have made enough

171
00:13:31,039 --> 00:13:32,759
to redeem our whole family

172
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:34,919
in another couple of years?

173
00:13:35,559 --> 00:13:36,360
Probably.

174
00:13:39,279 --> 00:13:41,039
Once we are no longer slaves,

175
00:13:41,624 --> 00:13:43,600
we will find you
a good family to marry into.

176
00:13:46,279 --> 00:13:48,679
Then, your father and I
will not be embarrassed

177
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:51,480
when we meet your biological mother
in the underworld.

178
00:13:55,879 --> 00:13:56,639
That's enough.

179
00:13:58,200 --> 00:13:59,080
That's enough.

180
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:00,240
Let's eat.

181
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:00,799
Yes.

182
00:14:02,679 --> 00:14:03,240
Here.

183
00:14:03,759 --> 00:14:06,240
You are still growing.

184
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:08,159
Eat more.

185
00:14:09,200 --> 00:14:09,720
Eat.

186
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:12,759
Father.

187
00:14:13,799 --> 00:14:14,480
Here.

188
00:14:14,919 --> 00:14:16,039
Take one.

189
00:14:17,559 --> 00:14:19,039
- You, too.
- I don't want it.

190
00:14:20,879 --> 00:14:21,759
I'm young.

191
00:14:22,159 --> 00:14:23,120
I'll get a wing.

192
00:14:23,416 --> 00:14:25,480
I still need to spread my wings
and soar higher.

193
00:14:28,120 --> 00:14:28,759
All right.

194
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:30,799
Let's accept her blessing.

195
00:14:31,559 --> 00:14:34,320
We'll let her
bring our family to greater heights.

196
00:14:36,720 --> 00:14:37,519
I'll eat a leg.

197
00:14:37,559 --> 00:14:38,360
Eating a leg

198
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:39,399
makes me run faster

199
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:41,480
so I can catch up to you two.

200
00:14:42,919 --> 00:14:43,320
Eat.

201
00:14:52,679 --> 00:14:54,039
Orders from the head butler.

202
00:14:54,670 --> 00:14:56,568
Everyone, come out
and listen to his orders.

203
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:11,879
Orders from the head butler.

204
00:15:12,664 --> 00:15:14,640
(Han Dongqing, Madam Qin's Housekeeper)
Every daughter

205
00:15:14,759 --> 00:15:16,559
who has reached the age of 14

206
00:15:16,879 --> 00:15:18,759
and is yet to marry someone

207
00:15:19,112 --> 00:15:21,120
must enter the residence
and work as servants.

208
00:15:26,660 --> 00:15:29,900
(Lv Er, Lv Ji'er's Father)

209
00:15:31,279 --> 00:15:32,240
Madam,

210
00:15:32,279 --> 00:15:33,279
why are they

211
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:35,320
summoning the daughters
into the residence?

212
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:37,320
This is the master's order.

213
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:38,519
You're just a slave.

214
00:15:38,520 --> 00:15:40,232
Why are you asking so many questions?

215
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:47,320
Lv Ji'er.

216
00:15:50,759 --> 00:15:51,559
Yes.

217
00:15:57,840 --> 00:15:58,759
Xu Lanxiang.

218
00:16:22,759 --> 00:16:23,600
Both of you,

219
00:16:23,639 --> 00:16:24,519
get ready.

220
00:16:24,879 --> 00:16:25,759
Tomorrow morning,

221
00:16:25,840 --> 00:16:27,200
I'll come and pick you two up.

222
00:16:29,559 --> 00:16:30,480
- Dear!
- Mother!

223
00:16:30,960 --> 00:16:31,799
- Dear!
- Mother!

224
00:16:37,039 --> 00:16:38,720
Lanxiang must not enter the residence.

225
00:16:39,440 --> 00:16:40,279
Otherwise,

226
00:16:40,312 --> 00:16:43,048
I'll be too embarrassed to meet
her biological mother in the future.

227
00:16:51,360 --> 00:16:52,080
Mother,

228
00:16:52,360 --> 00:16:53,480
calm down.

229
00:16:53,759 --> 00:16:55,440
There's another way.

230
00:16:56,039 --> 00:16:57,720
What alternative is there?

231
00:16:59,799 --> 00:17:00,600
I think

232
00:17:00,720 --> 00:17:02,840
the master summoning people
into the residence

233
00:17:02,960 --> 00:17:04,039
is a strange move.

234
00:17:05,432 --> 00:17:06,310
Logically speaking,

235
00:17:06,359 --> 00:17:07,960
families like the Lin family

236
00:17:08,039 --> 00:17:10,440
have rules when they pick servants.

237
00:17:11,079 --> 00:17:12,359
They won't

238
00:17:12,440 --> 00:17:13,559
suddenly issue an order

239
00:17:13,880 --> 00:17:16,519
and only summon ladies
who have come of age.

240
00:17:16,880 --> 00:17:18,599
She's right.

241
00:17:19,319 --> 00:17:21,119
In the past,

242
00:17:21,559 --> 00:17:23,559
if someone wants to send their daughters

243
00:17:23,559 --> 00:17:24,920
into the residence,

244
00:17:25,559 --> 00:17:27,359
they have to pay

245
00:17:27,440 --> 00:17:29,079
the madam.

246
00:17:30,720 --> 00:17:31,720
No matter what,

247
00:17:32,039 --> 00:17:33,440
there's one type of person

248
00:17:33,880 --> 00:17:35,279
that the Lin family will not accept.

249
00:17:35,960 --> 00:17:37,920
Which kind?

250
00:17:39,400 --> 00:17:40,720
The ones with an illness.

251
00:17:43,720 --> 00:17:45,519
Why did I forget about this?

252
00:17:46,680 --> 00:17:47,559
Let me tell you.

253
00:17:49,359 --> 00:17:50,640
Find someone

254
00:17:50,720 --> 00:17:52,839
to pay some money

255
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:54,079
to the madam.

256
00:17:54,319 --> 00:17:55,440
Ask her to report

257
00:17:55,559 --> 00:17:57,880
Lanxiang's illness,

258
00:17:57,944 --> 00:17:59,448
so she cannot enter the residence.

259
00:17:59,960 --> 00:18:02,079
I'll ask the head shopkeeper
to plead for us right away.

260
00:18:02,519 --> 00:18:04,039
I'm sure the head shopkeeper knows her.

261
00:18:04,480 --> 00:18:05,200
Go.

262
00:18:06,839 --> 00:18:07,440
Money.

263
00:18:07,480 --> 00:18:08,240
Money.

264
00:18:09,480 --> 00:18:10,079
Lanxiang.

265
00:18:10,440 --> 00:18:11,720
Help your father take it out.

266
00:18:18,279 --> 00:18:18,920
Take it.

267
00:18:19,440 --> 00:18:20,200
Let me tell you.

268
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:21,440
We can still make more money,

269
00:18:21,496 --> 00:18:23,310
but Lanxiang
must never enter the residence.

270
00:18:23,559 --> 00:18:24,599
I know.

271
00:18:35,960 --> 00:18:37,119
I've let you down.

272
00:18:39,839 --> 00:18:40,559
Mom.

273
00:18:41,319 --> 00:18:43,200
Don't say such a thing ever again.

274
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:47,279
You and Father gave me a new life.

275
00:18:48,640 --> 00:18:49,799
Even if I die,

276
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:52,160
I will never let you enter the residence

277
00:18:52,480 --> 00:18:53,480
to serve others.

278
00:18:54,440 --> 00:18:55,240
Mother.

279
00:18:56,119 --> 00:18:57,680
I'm not afraid of doing that.

280
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:00,480
I can do anything now.

281
00:19:01,440 --> 00:19:02,720
Don't worry.

282
00:19:08,359 --> 00:19:09,480
Drink your medicine.

283
00:19:10,264 --> 00:19:11,680
The temperature is just right.

284
00:19:35,039 --> 00:19:36,079
So pretty.

285
00:19:36,680 --> 00:19:37,680
With this face of yours,

286
