290
00:19:46,568 --> 00:19:48,248
like the other women in the residence.

291
00:19:48,839 --> 00:19:51,319
You'll even have a maid serving you
when you go out.

292
00:19:54,440 --> 00:19:56,024
When you finally live a good life,

293
00:19:56,072 --> 00:19:58,740
don't forget to put in a good word
for both your younger brothers.

294
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:02,680
Quick, lie down.

295
00:20:06,960 --> 00:20:07,640
It'll be fine.

296
00:20:10,079 --> 00:20:11,480
