297
00:20:11,599 --> 00:20:12,680
There's no problem, right?

298
00:20:12,720 --> 00:20:14,079
Don't worry.

299
00:20:14,100 --> 00:20:15,820
When I told the head shopkeeper
last night,

300
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:17,079
he agreed to help

301
