306
00:20:38,119 --> 00:20:39,640
Everyone, wake up! Wake up!

307
00:20:41,160 --> 00:20:41,960
Mother.

308
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:44,400
Madam Han is here.

309
00:20:44,680 --> 00:20:45,119
