329
00:22:17,039 --> 00:22:18,039
Madam, look.

330
00:22:19,279 --> 00:22:20,759
My daughter is ill.

331
00:22:21,480 --> 00:22:22,799
She's not fit

332
00:22:22,880 --> 00:22:25,079
to enter the residence
in her current condition.

333
00:22:26,279 --> 00:22:28,000
She looked fine yesterday.

334
00:22:28,160 --> 00:22:29,680
Why did she get ill all of a sudden?

335
00:22:30,160 --> 00:22:31,759
I heard people say

336
00:22:31,839 --> 00:22:34,200
that both of you
care about your daughter a lot,

337
00:22:34,360 --> 00:22:35,920
but she's just entering the residence

338
00:22:36,000 --> 00:22:37,839
and is not going to die.

339
00:22:38,160 --> 00:22:40,119
Since Lanxiang is pretty

340
00:22:40,279 --> 00:22:41,640
and has a nice character,

341
00:22:41,688 --> 00:22:43,920
