to the residence!

391
00:24:09,319 --> 00:24:10,360
Don't do this. Don't be stupid.

392
00:24:10,376 --> 00:24:11,400
Father, calm down.

393
00:24:11,440 --> 00:24:12,232
It's my first time

394
