550
00:30:25,079 --> 00:30:26,519
Head Shopkeeper, you are right.

551
00:30:27,912 --> 00:30:30,260
Although the officials don't care
if we don't make a report,

552
00:30:30,279 --> 00:30:31,160
according to the law,

553
00:30:31,319 --> 00:30:33,440
