559
00:30:45,559 --> 00:30:47,559
and claimed he wanted to kill me.

560
00:30:47,839 --> 00:30:50,680
I have witnesses and evidence.

561
00:30:51,200 --> 00:30:52,200
If I send him

562
00:30:52,200 --> 00:30:54,039
to the officials...

563
00:30:54,088 --> 00:30:55,768
Those who assault someone with a weapon,

564
00:30:55,799 --> 00:30:56,880
regardless of the situation,

565
00:30:56,950 --> 00:30:59,112
will be flogged 100 times
and imprisoned for 10 years.

566
00:30:59,279 --> 00:31:01,079
My father attacked someone with a knife.

567
00:31:01,480 --> 00:31:04,079
He should be heavily punished
according to the law.

568
00:31:08,400 --> 00:31:10,160
However, there's another law

569
00:31:11,440 --> 00:31:14,359
saying that when a thief steals,

570
00:31:14,599 --> 00:31:15,480
everyone who benefits,

571
00:31:15,559 --> 00:31:16,640
regardless of status,

572
00:31:16,759 --> 00:31:18,039
will be punished equally.

573
00:31:18,279 --> 00:31:19,839
Those who steal 80 silver

574
00:31:20,240 --> 00:31:21,519
will be hanged.

575
00:31:21,880 --> 00:31:24,039
Slaves who steal their master's assets

576
00:31:24,440 --> 00:31:25,799
will follow this law.

577
00:31:30,920 --> 00:31:32,440
What do you mean?

578
00:31:33,640 --> 00:31:35,400
As the head shopkeeper
of Rongbao Pavilion,

579
00:31:35,480 --> 00:31:37,960
you are even trying
to steal my family's 20 silver.

580
00:31:38,079 --> 00:31:39,680
If you don't lack money,

581
00:31:39,759 --> 00:31:40,559
that means

582
00:31:41,559 --> 00:31:43,640
someone is going to check the accounts.

583
00:31:48,799 --> 00:31:49,359
Shopkeeper...

584
00:31:50,680 --> 00:31:52,720
Just send my father to the officials.

585
00:31:52,840 --> 00:31:53,830
When two slaves argue,

586
00:31:53,839 --> 00:31:55,230
they'll have their own arguments.

587
00:31:55,240 --> 00:31:56,960
The master will surely send someone.

588
00:31:57,200 --> 00:31:58,160
When the time comes,

589
00:31:58,440 --> 00:32:00,480
do you dare explain everything

590
00:32:01,799 --> 00:32:04,599
in front of everyone?

591
00:32:15,000 --> 00:32:16,319
Let go.

592
00:32:16,400 --> 00:32:17,359
Let go!

593
00:32:37,640 --> 00:32:38,039
Lanxiang.

594
00:32:38,480 --> 00:32:40,720
Weren't you taken away by Madam Han?

595
00:32:42,359 --> 00:32:44,000
I pleaded with Madam Han.

596
00:32:44,039 --> 00:32:45,640
She allowed me to come back for a while.

597
00:32:54,000 --> 00:32:55,039
Don't worry, Father.

598
00:32:55,720 --> 00:32:57,160
After I enter the residence,

599
00:32:58,119 --> 00:32:59,279
I'll be fine.

600
00:32:59,920 --> 00:33:01,599
You and Mother have to take care.

601
00:33:03,291 --> 00:33:04,720
I'll still say the same thing.

602
00:33:07,039 --> 00:33:09,000
We won't be slaves forever.

603
00:33:09,720 --> 00:33:10,559
One day,

604
00:33:10,936 --> 00:33:12,510
we will be able to redeem ourselves.

605
00:33:20,640 --> 00:33:21,640
Father, my mother

606
00:33:22,319 --> 00:33:24,039
and you must live well.

607
00:33:27,480 --> 00:33:28,200
Otherwise,

608
00:33:29,160 --> 00:33:30,960
I will be alone

609
00:33:31,279 --> 00:33:32,359
in this world.

610
00:33:32,920 --> 00:33:34,440
I won't be able to live on.

611
00:33:40,480 --> 00:33:41,680
I will remember.

612
00:33:43,759 --> 00:33:44,960
I will live well.

613
00:33:46,559 --> 00:33:48,160
All of us must do so.

614
00:34:15,639 --> 00:34:16,760
Lanxiang!

615
00:34:31,199 --> 00:34:31,920
It's fine.

616
00:34:32,119 --> 00:34:33,119
It's fine. Don't worry.

617
00:34:41,256 --> 00:34:45,540
(Glorify the Family Name)

618
00:35:33,544 --> 00:35:35,360
The first person on the left
of the front row

619
00:35:35,519 --> 00:35:37,159
is the third daughter
of the Zhou family,

620
00:35:37,199 --> 00:35:38,239
Zhou Gantang.

621
00:35:39,599 --> 00:35:40,679
The person next to her

622
00:35:40,960 --> 00:35:42,039
is Lv Ji'er.

623
00:35:42,039 --> 00:35:43,400
The third person in the middle

624
00:35:43,400 --> 00:35:44,719
is Du Xiaolian.

625
00:35:45,000 --> 00:35:48,239
The fourth person is Xu Lanxiang.

626
00:35:48,960 --> 00:35:50,360
These four girls

627
00:35:50,719 --> 00:35:52,360
are the prettiest.

628
00:36:05,780 --> 00:36:11,380
(Xu Lanxiang, Lv Ji'er,
Zhou Gantang, Du Xiaolian)

629
00:36:14,039 --> 00:36:14,960
Calm down.

630
00:36:15,320 --> 00:36:16,719
Young Master will be here soon.

631
00:36:27,480 --> 00:36:28,280
Young Master.

632
00:36:30,719 --> 00:36:31,440
Young Master.

633
00:36:41,480 --> 00:36:43,360
You said
you have something urgent to tell me.

634
00:36:44,000 --> 00:36:45,079
Don't tell me

635
00:36:46,480 --> 00:36:48,159
it's to have a reunion dinner with me.

636
00:36:49,280 --> 00:36:50,079
Young Master,

637
00:36:50,400 --> 00:36:51,480
try this soup.

638
00:36:51,550 --> 00:36:53,352
Young Madam made it herself.

639
00:37:04,480 --> 00:37:05,079
What is it?

640
00:37:05,880 --> 00:37:06,320
Tell me.

641
00:37:10,888 --> 00:37:13,190
Father organized a banquet today
at the Zhao residence

642
00:37:14,159 --> 00:37:16,000
to welcome you back home.

643
00:37:19,920 --> 00:37:20,960
How unfortunate.

644
00:37:21,719 --> 00:37:23,800
I still need to hand over my duties
at the Garrison.

645
00:37:24,848 --> 00:37:26,527
I appreciate your father's offer,

646
00:37:29,792 --> 00:37:31,151
but I'm afraid I have to decline.

647
00:37:33,480 --> 00:37:34,559
Lin Jinqi!

648
00:37:34,880 --> 00:37:37,360
I came just at the right time.

649
00:37:37,480 --> 00:37:38,239
See?

650
00:37:38,320 --> 00:37:40,440
Young Master and Young Madam
are both here.

651
00:37:57,039 --> 00:37:58,239
Madam Han, you're here?

652
00:37:58,480 --> 00:37:59,599
Please come in.

653
00:38:08,119 --> 00:38:09,320
Stand properly.

654
00:38:10,039 --> 00:38:11,920
Greet Young Master and Young Madam.

655
00:38:12,504 --> 00:38:13,800
- Young Master.
- Young Master.

656
00:38:13,920 --> 00:38:15,080
- Young Madam.
- Young Madam.

657
00:38:18,559 --> 00:38:20,000
There are 12 hereditary slaves

658
00:38:20,000 --> 00:38:21,519
who came of age this time.

659
00:38:22,559 --> 00:38:24,599
First Madam chose these four

660
00:38:25,679 --> 00:38:27,199
and ordered me to bring them

661
00:38:27,679 --> 00:38:29,760
to Zhichun Hall to serve you both.

662
00:38:32,119 --> 00:38:34,119
Please tell First Madam

663
00:38:34,296 --> 00:38:35,550
we appreciate her kindness,

664
00:38:35,800 --> 00:38:37,639
but Zhichun Hall has enough staff.

665
00:38:39,000 --> 00:38:40,119
Young Madam,

666
00:38:40,360 --> 00:38:41,559
First Madam said

667
00:38:41,599 --> 00:38:43,360
it's tough managing the household.

668
00:38:43,599 --> 00:38:45,079
Now that Young Master has returned,

669
00:38:45,480 --> 00:38:46,199
Zhichun Hall

670
00:38:46,280 --> 00:38:48,559
will need more servants.

671
00:38:49,119 --> 00:38:50,480
First Madam

672
00:38:50,599 --> 00:38:51,880
really liked

673
00:38:52,159 --> 00:38:54,360
these four servants'
appearances and personalities.

674
00:38:54,480 --> 00:38:56,880
They are way better
than the previous ones who were rude.

675
00:38:57,639 --> 00:38:59,280
She also mentioned

676
00:38:59,639 --> 00:39:01,239
that Young Master's return

677
00:39:01,360 --> 00:39:02,480
made her

678
00:39:02,599 --> 00:39:04,320
feel at ease.

679
00:39:04,800 --> 00:39:06,440
If she can see

680
00:39:06,440 --> 00:39:08,920
you two giving birth to a few children,

681
00:39:09,159 --> 00:39:10,639
she will be

682
00:39:11,039 --> 00:39:12,679
very relieved.

683
00:39:27,480 --> 00:39:29,119
Since they were picked
by First Madam,

684
00:39:31,360 --> 00:39:33,119
just keep them
and assign them some chores.

685
00:40:05,440 --> 00:40:06,519
What is your name?

686
00:40:07,639 --> 00:40:08,719
What does your family do?

687
00:40:08,960 --> 00:40:09,719
What do you know?

688
00:40:09,719 --> 00:40:10,639
Tell me everything.

689
00:40:19,320 --> 00:40:20,119
My surname is Zhou.

690
00:40:20,559 --> 00:40:21,360
I am Gantang.

691
00:40:21,599 --> 00:40:22,159
How dare you.

692
00:40:22,800 --> 00:40:23,519
How dare you

693
00:40:23,519 --> 00:40:25,000
share the same name as Young Madam?

694
00:40:25,320 --> 00:40:26,159
Slap yourself.

695
00:40:28,536 --> 00:40:29,630
I deserve to be punished!

696
00:40:29,710 --> 00:40:30,904
I deserve to be punished!

697
00:40:33,639 --> 00:40:34,639
From today onward,

698
00:40:35,639 --> 00:40:36,920
your name is Yingge.

699
00:40:40,159 --> 00:40:41,719
Thank you for granting me a name.

700
00:40:43,000 --> 00:40:44,159
Young Madam,

701
00:40:44,960 --> 00:40:47,239
my mother was
First Madam's dowry servant.

702
00:40:47,240 --> 00:40:49,060
(Zhou Gantang (Yingge))
I'm good at gardening,

703
00:40:49,079 --> 00:40:50,280
making pastries,

704
00:40:50,800 --> 00:40:52,159
and making fragrances.

705
00:41:07,320 --> 00:41:08,360
My surname is Du.

706
00:41:08,800 --> 00:41:09,679
My name is Xiaolian.

707
00:41:10,159 --> 00:41:11,159
My father

708
00:41:11,160 --> 00:41:13,260
(Du Xiaolian)
used to serve under the Second Master.

709
00:41:13,400 --> 00:41:14,760
After he passed away,

710
00:41:14,960 --> 00:41:16,880
my mother became a nightsoil collector.

711
00:41:17,559 --> 00:41:19,639
I... I don't know

712
00:41:19,639 --> 00:41:21,119
what I can do.

713
00:41:21,920 --> 00:41:23,800
My mother says I only know how to eat.

714
00:41:23,848 --> 00:41:25,832
Don't be rude
in front of the Young Madam.

715
00:41:34,679 --> 00:41:35,559
My surname is Lv.

716
00:41:35,719 --> 00:41:36,800
My name is Ji'er.

717
00:41:37,320 --> 00:41:39,559
My grandfather was the vice manor head.

718
00:41:39,840 --> 00:41:41,639
I can cook and do laundry.

719
00:41:42,039 --> 00:41:44,159
I raise my younger brothers at home.

720
00:41:46,519 --> 00:41:48,000
I'm also good at embroidery.

721
00:41:48,840 --> 00:41:50,039
Young Madam, look.

722
00:41:50,519 --> 00:41:52,079
I made this pattern.

723
00:42:12,159 --> 00:42:13,119
My surname is Xu.

724
00:42:13,239 --> 00:42:14,159
My name is Lanxiang.

725
00:42:15,119 --> 00:42:17,440
My father is
the third shopkeeper of the curio shop.

726
00:42:19,199 --> 00:42:19,800
I...

727
00:42:21,159 --> 00:42:22,199
Ji'er and I

728
00:42:22,199 --> 00:42:23,880
grew up in the same household.

729
00:42:24,119 --> 00:42:26,800
We usually cook, do laundry,

730
00:42:27,599 --> 00:42:28,760
and embroider together.

731
00:42:31,176 --> 00:42:32,880
This is a handkerchief I embroidered.

732
00:42:35,480 --> 00:42:36,280
That's enough.

733
00:42:41,480 --> 00:42:42,360
Qingxiang.

734
00:42:43,559 --> 00:42:44,679
Take them away

735
00:42:45,719 --> 00:42:47,119
and teach them the rules.

736
00:42:48,159 --> 00:42:50,280
Assign some chores to them.

737
00:42:52,360 --> 00:42:52,920
Yes.

738
00:43:05,300 --> 00:43:07,700
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

739
00:43:11,559 --> 00:43:12,719
Look. What is this?

740
00:43:14,360 --> 00:43:15,199
Money?

741
00:43:16,360 --> 00:43:17,960
You're becoming a bigger fool.

742
00:43:18,159 --> 00:43:20,679
This is money
given to me by Young Master.

743
00:43:22,984 --> 00:43:25,096
You get money
just by delivering him a pot of tea?

744
00:43:25,679 --> 00:43:28,239
Young Master said
I'm capable and quick-witted.

745
00:43:31,159 --> 00:43:32,119
Young Master asked me

746
00:43:32,232 --> 00:43:33,670
why the Young Madam came to our place

747
00:43:33,679 --> 00:43:35,119
in the pouring rain yesterday.

748
00:43:35,599 --> 00:43:37,360
I told him about the sutra.

749
00:43:38,360 --> 00:43:40,880
Now, Young Master
will surely remember my name.

750
00:43:42,960 --> 00:43:45,119
Young Madam also remembers your name.

751
00:44:00,620 --> 00:44:04,740
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

752
00:44:07,580 --> 00:44:12,100
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

753
00:44:13,380 --> 00:44:17,300
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

754
00:44:17,980 --> 00:44:20,740
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

755
00:44:21,460 --> 00:44:23,780
♪Though all the world may fade♪

756
00:44:23,780 --> 00:44:26,860
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

757
00:44:28,380 --> 00:44:32,620
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

758
00:44:35,540 --> 00:44:39,700
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

759
00:44:41,500 --> 00:44:45,060
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

760
00:44:45,060 --> 00:44:48,620
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

761
00:44:49,420 --> 00:44:55,100
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

762
00:44:55,460 --> 00:44:59,780
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

763
00:45:00,140 --> 00:45:03,100
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

764
00:45:03,100 --> 00:45:06,860
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

765
00:45:06,860 --> 00:45:09,740
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

766
00:45:09,740 --> 00:45:13,820
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

767
00:45:13,820 --> 00:45:17,180
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

768
00:45:17,180 --> 00:45:20,940
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

769
00:45:20,940 --> 00:45:24,940
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

770
00:45:25,700 --> 00:45:29,860
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

771
00:45:29,860 --> 00:45:33,300
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

772
00:45:33,300 --> 00:45:36,940
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

773
00:45:36,940 --> 00:45:39,820
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

774
00:45:39,820 --> 00:45:43,900
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

775
00:45:43,900 --> 00:45:47,260
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

776
00:45:47,260 --> 00:45:50,900
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

777
00:45:50,900 --> 00:45:58,700
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
